description.p:
Furthermore, high preference is given to a compound selected from 2-[(4-pyridyl)methyl]amino-Λ/-[3-fluoro-(4-trifluoromethyl)phenyl]benzamide; 2-[(4-pyridyl)methyl]amino-/V-phenylbenzamide; 2-[(4-pyridyl)methyl]amino-/V-[4-fluoro-3-(trifluoromethyl)phenyl]benzamide; 

