hyl]amino- V-(4-chlorophenyl)benzamide; -[2-(4-pyridyl)ethyl]amino-N-[3-(trifluoromethyl)phenyl]benzamide; -[2-(3-pyridyl)ethyl]amino-N-[3-(trifluoromethyl)phenyl]benzamide; 

